      "adrOrDoc": "docs/architecture/decisions/ADR-008-retire-account-isactive-and-schema-v8.md",
      "justification": "Android Drift AccountsTable only persists isArchived and has never persisted isActive; keeping both created redundant non-persistent account state across platforms.",
      "migrationStrategy": "Standardize Account lifecycle on isArchived across shared_foundation, Flutter, and Web; legacy Web/backup account objects carrying isActive: false remain harmlessly ignored or mapped to isArchived during assembly without failing older snapshots.",
